ciency\n- **Data Collection**: Improve data collection on velocity and resolution trends for better analysis.\n- **Resource Management**: Monitor burn rate and adjust resources to maintain sustainable operations.\n- **Priority Management**: Focus on resolving high-priority issues promptly to prevent escalation.\n- **Continuous Monitoring**: Implement dashboards for real-time tracking of key metrics to facilitate proactive management."
